# 1. Search History Tests (4 Failures) ⭐ Easiest Fix

All these failures are the same bug.

```
ForeignKeyViolation:
Key (user_id)=... is not present in table "users"
```

Your model is correct.

```python
user_id = mapped_column(
    ForeignKey("users.id", ondelete="CASCADE")
)
```

The tests are wrong.

They do

```python
_insert_history(
    db_session,
    user_id=uuid.uuid4()
)
```

That UUID doesn't exist inside the users table.

Postgres correctly rejects it.

