## Correct approach

Create another user.

Example

```python
other_user = User(
    first_name="Other",
    last_name="User",
    email="other@example.com",
    password_hash="hashed",
)
db_session.add(other_user)
db_session.flush()

_insert_history(
    db_session,
    user_id=other_user.id
)
```

or reuse a fixture

```
second_registered_user
```

if you already have one.

