# 2. Flight Search Tests (7 Failures)

These are all coming from

```
FlightSearchParams ValidationError
```

Notice they fail BEFORE hitting the endpoint.

```
ValidationError

FlightSearchParams
```

That means your schema became stricter than the tests expect.

Common reasons:

* new required field
* enum changed
* date validation
* Literal changed
* regex changed

You need the FIRST ValidationError.

Run

```
pytest tests/test_flights.py -vv
```

or

```
pytest tests/test_flights.py::TestFlightSearchSuccess::test_successful_search_returns_200 -vv
```

Read the FIRST ValidationError.

It will say something like

```
field required
```

or

```
Input should be one of...
```

That is the real issue.

