# 3. Missing Amadeus Client (2 Failures)

```
AttributeError

State has no attribute amadeus
```

Your endpoint probably does

```python
request.app.state.amadeus
```

but the test app never sets it.

Usually inside startup you have

```python
app.state.amadeus = AmadeusClient(...)
```

Your test app probably skips lifespan.

Need either

```
dependency override
```

or

```
fixture
```

that injects

```python
FakeAmadeus()
```

