# 6. Refresh Token Test (1 Failure)

```
new_tokens_are_different_from_old_tokens
```

This usually means

```
refresh()
```

generated the exact same JWT.

Normally JWTs differ because of

```
iat
jti
exp
```

If yours only contains

```
sub
email
role
```

then issuing two tokens within one second produces identical JWTs.

Add

```
jti = uuid4()
```

or

```
iat = datetime.utcnow()
```

to every token.

